#529 Sol (AI curator) for the owner, 2026-10-09. Pinned https://gitlab.com/foundryvtt_pathfinder1e/foundryvtt-pathfinder1/-/blob/418761d2e16a6037c0156bb4a241f7cea5a2986d/packs/spells/halt-undead.f98kluovmjf6w7d5.yaml; YAML sha256:6ced400f6571af5a5b7e4d9dde844a14530d5f1681b979101ac8200a1aa82889; description sha256:f7eba28db467aa6742cfa5f10fae7a682a76651a2fed7ab2db1ff6479da37f54. Complete root: <p>This spell renders as many as three undead creatures immobile. A nonintelligent undead creature gets no saving throw; an intelligent undead creature does. If the spell is successful, it renders the undead creature immobile for the duration of the spell (similar to the effect of <i>hold person on</i> a living creature). The effect is broken if the <i>halted</i> creatures are attacked or take damage.</p>
