#529 Sol (AI curator) for the owner, 2026-10-09. Pinned https://gitlab.com/foundryvtt_pathfinder1e/foundryvtt-pathfinder1/-/blob/418761d2e16a6037c0156bb4a241f7cea5a2986d/packs/spells/transmute-mud-to-rock.fdg9goug5f6s1qtx.yaml; YAML sha256:6004bfe463150ddb8e7b83c7961b3b8903eee7d12863c7699dc9d495363c67b0; description sha256:9c46e4929b0f50ddf2f4b8cf335ef8f0ea481554279ab9dfd93a755019296ba0. Complete root: <p>This spell permanently transforms normal mud or quicksand of any depth into soft stone (sandstone or a similar mineral).</p><p>Any creature in the mud is allowed a Reflex save to escape before the area is hardened to stone.</p><p><i>Transmute mud to rock</i> counters and dispels <i>transmute rock to mud</i>.</p>
