t also grant the bonuses and penalties relating to undead, as given above. Desecrate counters and dispels consecrate.|PRERULE:1,DisplayFullSpell","lineSha256":"db89449f3f9be91af0cac3b3c62007a946f7ac342008d916e3a64c2efe28e1c4","role":"same-spell-body","normalizedEqual":true}}
