Inherited evidence: [{"book":"PZO1110","reason":"Complete UUID-linked or explicitly inspected named rule body; cited publication minimum only.","evidence":"<p>This spell makes the duration of certain other spells permanent.</p><p>You first cast the desired spell and then follow it with the <i>permanency</i> spell.</p><p>Depending on the spell, you must be of a minimum caster level and must expend a specific gp value of diamond dust as a material component.</p><p>You can make the following spells permanent in regard to yourself.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Spell</th><th>Minimum Caster Level</th><th>GP Cost</th></tr><tr><td><i>Arcane sight</i></td><td>11th</td><td>7,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Comprehend languages</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Darkvision</i></td><td>10th</td><td>5,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Detect magic</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Read magic</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>See invisibility</i></td><td>10th</td><td>5,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Tongues</i></td><td>11th</td><td>7,500 gp</td></tr></tbody></table><p>You cannot cast these spells on other creatures. This application of <i>permanency</i> can be dispelled only by a caster of higher level than you were when you cast the spell.</p><p>In addition to personal use, <i>permanency</i> can be used to make the following spells permanent on yourself, another creature, or an object (as appropriate).</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Spell</th><th>Minimum Caster Level</th><th>GP Cost</th></tr><tr><td><i>Enlarge person</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Magic fang</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Magic fang, greater</i></td><td>11th</td><td>7,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Reduce person</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Resistance</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Telepathic bond</i>*</td><td>13th</td><td>12,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\">*Only bonds two creatures per casting of <i>permanency</i>.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Additionally, the following spells can be cast upon objects or areas only and rendered permanent.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Spell</th><th>Minimum Caster Level</th><th>GP Cost</th></tr><tr><td><i>Alarm</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Animate objects</i></td><td>14th</td><td>15,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Dancing lights</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Ghost sound</i></td><td>9th</td><td>2,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Gust of wind</i></td><td>11th</td><td>7,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Invisibility</i></td><td>10th</td><td>5,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Mage's private sanctum</i></td><td>13th</td><td>12,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Magic mouth</i></td><td>10th</td><td>5,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Phase door</i></td><td>15th</td><td>17,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Prismatic sphere</i></td><td>17th</td><td>22,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Prismatic wall</i></td><td>16th</td><td>20,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Shrink item</i></td><td>11th</td><td>7,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Solid fog</i></td><td>12th</td><td>10,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Stinking cloud</i></td><td>11th</td><td>7,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of death</i></td><td>16th</td><td>20,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of fear</i></td><td>14th</td><td>15,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of insanity</i></td><td>16th</td><td>20,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of pain</i></td><td>13th</td><td>12,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of persuasion</i></td><td>14th</td><td>15,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of sleep</i></td><td>16th</td><td>20,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of stunning</i></td><td>15th</td><td>17,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Symbol of Weakness</i></td><td>15th</td><td>17,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Teleportation circle</i></td><td>17th</td><td>22,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Wall of Fire</i></td><td>12th</td><td>10,000 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Wall of Force</i></td><td>13th</td><td>12,500 gp</td></tr><tr><td><i>Web</i></td><td>10th</td><td>5,000 gp</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Spells cast on other targets are vulnerable to <i>dispel magic</i> as normal. The GM may allow other spells to be made permanent.</p>","evidenceSha256":"cf6a14c3f2f5c69b7f360656534b188599094a631c0b1c7def245d77731d2d72","sourceLocation":"https://gitlab.com/foundryvtt_pathfinder1e/foundryvtt-pathfinder1/-/blob/418761d2e16a6037c0156bb4a241f7cea5a2986d/packs/spells/permanency.nsxngq65mbrzgwnm.yaml","sourceDescriptionSha256":"cf6a14c3f2f5c69b7f360656534b188599094a631c0b1c7def245d77731d2d72","sourceFileSha256":"259891f8e53513dbaf4015dd580c055d09ea7840b8b5d5feb07483d22704df15","comparisonEvidence":[],"role":"complete-source-body"},{"book":"PZO1110","reason":"Complete UUID-linked or explicitly inspected named rule body; cited publication minimum only.","evidence":"<p>A bank of fog billows out from the point you designate. The fog obscures all sight, including darkvision, beyond 5 feet. A creature within 5 feet has concealment (attacks have a 20% miss chance).</p><p>Creatures farther away have total concealment (50% miss chance, and the attacker can't use sight to locate the target).</p><p>A moderate wind (11+ mph) disperses the fog in 4 rounds; a strong wind (21+ mph) disperses the fog in 1 round.</p><p>The spell does not function underwater.</p>","evidenceSha256":"f49d8c0ddb27b161a82c82d055f8baaa037d1366def55980294ef4c26d7f1592","sourceLocation":"https://gitlab.com/foundryvtt_pathfinder1e/foundryvtt-pathfinder1/-/blob/418761d2e16a6037c0156bb4a241f7cea5a2986d/packs/spells/fog-cloud.g33euis7yi9pwddy.yaml","sourceDescriptionSha256":"f49d8c0ddb27b161a82c82d055f8baaa037d1366def55980294ef4c26d7f1592","sourceFileSha256":"599578bfd922bb382c1d8d33f7a5a690a7cc3001362ba0ac12629468cf321922","comparisonEvidence":[],"role":"complete-source-body"},{"book":"PZO1110","reason":"Explicit core action, condition, damage, skill, save or component rule. PCGen declaration is a publication anchor, not a comparison to this particular clause.","evidence":"material component","evidenceSha256":"9a1fa015d5dbe22fbf4dd734ff6e2099da62a0c92027ee2f143e51f5647913b7","sourceLocation":"https://gitlab.com/foundryvtt_pathfinder1e/foundryvtt-pathfinder1/-/blob/418761d2e16a6037c0156bb4a241f7cea5a2986d/packs/spells/permanency.nsxngq65mbrzgwnm.yaml","sourceDescriptionSha256":"cf6a14c3f2f5c69b7f360656534b188599094a631c0b1c7def245d77731d2d72","sourceFileSha256":"259891f8e53513dbaf4015dd580c055d09ea7840b8b5d5feb07483d22704df15","comparisonEvidence":[{"source":"comparison/core_rulebook.pcc","line":14,"text":"SOURCELONG:Core Rulebook","textSha256":"8bde3fab596f83579c58382af615faef715a76cc261b532ab271caee71eb1fc5","fileSha256":"8638a1197e2a541695f3005feb1a6eb67569220a5b0f151bc37819d3121feb06","role":"publication-anchor","publicationDeclaration":{"line":14,"text":"SOURCELONG:Core Rulebook","textSha256":"8bde3fab596f83579c58382af615faef715a76cc261b532ab271caee71eb1fc5"}}],"role":"literal-source-excerpt"},{"book":"PZO1110","reason":"Explicit core action, condition, damage, skill, save or component rule. PCGen declaration is a publication anchor, not a comparison to this particular clause.","evidence":"concealment","evidenceSha256":"8325e5a49b2040c98e0dd752b368b601018cdf1d6efb49a389d39fbce1277395","sourceLocation":"https://gitlab.com/foundryvtt_pathfinder1e/foundryvtt-pathfinder1/-/blob/418761d2e16a6037c0156bb4a241f7cea5a2986d/packs/spells/fog-cloud.g33euis7yi9pwddy.yaml","sourceDescriptionSha256":"f49d8c0ddb27b161a82c82d055f8baaa037d1366def55980294ef4c26d7f1592","sourceFileSha256":"599578bfd922bb382c1d8d33f7a5a690a7cc3001362ba0ac12629468cf321922","comparisonEvidence":[{"source":"comparison/core_rulebook.pcc","line":14,"text":"SOURCELONG:Core Rulebook","textSha256":"8bde3fab596f83579c58382af615faef715a76cc261b532ab271caee71eb1fc5","fileSha256":"8638a1197e2a541695f3005feb1a6eb67569220a5b0f151bc37819d3121feb06","role":"publication-anchor","publicationDeclaration":{"line":14,"text":"SOURCELONG:Core Rulebook","textSha256":"8bde3fab596f8